{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORGMAN </strong>is a first-person horror game, a hybrid of classic survival horror and puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself deep in the forest, in an abandoned mansion with a dark past. You'll need to explore its dark corridors and rooms while staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/2f14e160ae3a4000736713413aac2083.poster.avif?t=1743097697\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/2f14e160ae3a4000736713413aac2083.webm?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/2f14e160ae3a4000736713413aac2083.mp4?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By gathering scattered clues and solving tricky puzzles, you'll come closer to unraveling the dark secrets of this place. And try not to become a victim of the unknown evil lurking within the mansion's walls, waiting for you in the most unexpected places.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sister is an archaeologist and hasn't been in touch with you for the past few days. You managed to pinpoint her last location, which led you to a remote place deep in the Lapland forests...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4c64af2dce0c385d3c320abeb1ca8d3d.poster.avif?t=1743097697\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4c64af2dce0c385d3c320abeb1ca8d3d.webm?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4c64af2dce0c385d3c320abeb1ca8d3d.mp4?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy: Intelligent, unpredictable, and adaptable. Every move you make forces it to learn and refine its hunting methods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptability and puzzles: Unravel the mansion's past by piecing together fragments of the family's memories through paintings, maps, and locks. Solve puzzles with wit, intelligence, or brute force, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4506fa3bac7a2579eeff85eea6757ee0.poster.avif?t=1743097697\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4506fa3bac7a2579eeff85eea6757ee0.webm?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4506fa3bac7a2579eeff85eea6757ee0.mp4?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror atmosphere: A unique atmosphere of constant fear and tension, conveyed through visual and sound effects, will allow you to fully immerse yourself in the world of horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and survival: Resources are limited, enemies are strong, and there are many secrets. By exploring every corner of the mansion, you increase your chances of making it out alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/ea1772c886232c8a4abf8925d335440d.poster.avif?t=1743097697\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/ea1772c886232c8a4abf8925d335440d.webm?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/ea1772c886232c8a4abf8925d335440d.mp4?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926350?t=1743097697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743097697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/e99155cbbdd888860c2d8c854c42f4bc55001477/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743097697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/e99155cbbdd888860c2d8c854c42f4bc55001477/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743097697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2939920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORGMAN </strong>is a first-person horror game, a hybrid of classic survival horror and puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself deep in the forest, in an abandoned mansion with a dark past. You'll need to explore its dark corridors and rooms while staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350