ability and puzzles: Unravel the mansion's past by piecing together fragments of the family's memories through paintings, maps, and locks. Solve puzzles with wit, intelligence, or brute force, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4506fa3bac7a2579eeff85eea6757ee0.poster.avif?t=1743097697\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4506fa3bac7a2579eeff85eea6757ee0.webm?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/4506fa3bac7a2579eeff85eea6757ee0.mp4?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror atmosphere: A unique atmosphere of constant fear and tension, conveyed through visual and sound effects, will allow you to fully immerse yourself in the world of horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and survival: Resources are limited, enemies are strong, and there are many secrets. By exploring every corner of the mansion, you increase your chances of making it out alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/ea1772c886232c8a4abf8925d335440d.poster.avif?t=1743097697\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/extras/ea1772c886232c8a4abf8925d335440d.webm?t=1743097697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926350/ex